  data: {
    LLM: 'Try to avoid winning tricks, especially in hands 1, 5, and 6. Get rid of high cards in dangerous suits early. In hand 4, avoid the king of spades at all costs.\n\nCount cards to track dangerous cards. In hand 2 (no hearts), try to become void in hearts early so you can discard them when other suits are led. In hand 6, the penalties stack dramatically - a single trick can cost hundreds of points.\n\nDuck tricks by playing middle cards when possible. Force opponents to win dangerous tricks. In hand 6, calculate the maximum penalty a trick could cost. Long-term strategy across all six hands - sometimes taking a small penalty early prevents a larger one later.',
    Player: 'Try to avoid winning tricks, especially in hands 1, 5, and 6. Get rid of high cards in dangerous suits early. In hand 4, avoid the king of spades at all costs.\n\nCount cards to track dangerous cards. In hand 2 (no hearts), try to become void in hearts early so you can discard them when other suits are led. In hand 6, the penalties stack dramatically - a single trick can cost hundreds of points.\n\nDuck tricks by playing middle cards when possible. Force opponents to win dangerous tricks. In hand 6, calculate the maximum penalty a trick could cost. Long-term strategy across all six hands - sometimes taking a small penalty early prevents a larger one later.',
